        rdfs:label "sha512" ;
        rdfs:comment "SHA-2 with a digest length of 512, as defined in [RFC 6234](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/rfc6234/)."@en .

    <https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/LifecycleScopeType/build> a owl:NamedIndividual,
